---
// Story — solving growth at the source
---
<section class="story section" id="story">
  <div class="container story-inner">
    <h2 class="display story-title reveal">
      Story: <em>solving growth at the source</em>
    </h2>
    <p class="story-body reveal">
      Above everything else, your business is a story about how you create change in the world.
      Everything else is just execution. Fix how you tell your story, and everything downstream
      falls into place.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story { background: var(--bg); }
  .story-inner { text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .story-title { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.8vw, 52px); line-height: 1.12; }
  .story-body {
    margin-top: 28px; max-width: 52ch;
    font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(15px, 1.3vw, 17px); line-height: 1.8; color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
